A [[Blue Archive]] character. First seen in the preview for Volume 6: "Oratorio of Bygone Time". Her full name is [b]Kakehashi Subaru[/b].

She has short, purple-tinted hair, [[purple eyes]], and wears a [[purple shirt]] with a [[purple necktie]] beneath her overcoat.

Her personal weapon is a [[H&K hk33]]A2 and [[Sig P228/P229|SIG P229]].

Voiced by: [[Amami Yurina]]
Original artist: [[nemoga]]

